Image SHA256: 2c23684c9cc5ef5899073b59844fa47cc3c1d894f2316e21f25d5d85be5a10e2
Unchanged sources from LLVM test-suite 2919e55176a572ee085cb46b291c47b7092c363e.
For each: cc -std=gnu11 -O0/-O2 SOURCE -lm -o program; execute program.
compare-fp-3.c also retains its original -fno-trapping-math.
Every listed source compiles and exits 0 in all four fixed-oracle configurations.
Full commands, diagnostics and outputs: .build/vector-targeted/llvm-floating-builtins-audit.jsonl.
Each disposition additionally binds the original LLVM compile arguments in the ledger.
This is not an EvoCC execution PASS or a newly measured full-campaign count.
builtin-nan-1.c is deliberately excluded: it only compares constant representations with memcmp.
Float/classify.c is also excluded: GCC lacks one of its builtin spellings.

Paths below are relative to SingleSource/Regression/C/gcc-c-torture/execute/.

